    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2019 the syndicate's gross claims outstanding was $568.26m. Analysis of the gross claims development triangle shows net adverse prior-year development of approximately $39.9m (c.7.0% of opening reserves), driven primarily by adverse development in recent years (notably underwriting years 2016 and 2017) related to large losses and liability exposures and the impact of major natural catastrophe events in 2017 and 2018. The report also notes a smaller net deterioration figure disclosed within net claims incurred ($9.07m), which is net of reinsurance. The syndicate highlights specific adverse development in the Non-Marine Liability class and material catastrophe activity in property classes in 2017-2018 as key contributors to the reserve strengthening.",
